      "text": "2025.09.19\tThe first paper of Ph.D. student Tatthapong Srikitrungruang was accepted by Advanced Science (IF > 14). Congratulations, Tatthapong!2025.09.01\tA new Ph.D. student, Tanvir Ahmed, joined our group. Welcome, Tanvir!2025.04.22\tPh.D. student Sina Aghaee was selected as a finalist in the IISE QCRE Best Student Paper Competition. Sina presented this work at the 2025 IISE Conference. Congratulations, Sina! 2025.02.01\tWe are excited to begin the \"Cannery 4.0\" industry project with Crider Foods and look forward to building real-time machine breakdown prediction AI model.2024.12.10\t\tDr. Lee received the Seed Program for AI, Computing, and Data Science (SPAICD) Award from the Texas A&M Institute of Data Science (TAMIDS). This award was featured in the College of Engineering News and the Dental Tribune International.",
      "blocks": [
        "<ul class=\"n8H08c UVNKR \" style=\"list-style-type: square; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 0;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" class=\"zfr3Q TYR86d eD0Rn \" style=\"list-style-type: none; margin-left: 15.0pt;\"><ul class=\"n8H08c UVNKR \" style=\"list-style-type: square; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 0;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" class=\"zfr3Q TYR86d eD0Rn \" style=\"margin-left: 15.0pt;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\" class=\"zfr3Q CDt4Ke \" style=\"margin-left: 0.0pt; padding-left: 0.0pt; text-indent: 0.0pt;\"><a class=\"XqQF9c\" href=\"http://2025.09.xx\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none;\"><span class=\"C9DxTc aw5Odc \" style=\"font-variant: normal;\">2025.09.</span></a><span class=\"C9DxTc \" style=\"font-variant: normal;\">19</span><span class=\"C9DxTc \" style=\"font-variant: normal;\"><span class=\"Apple-tab-span \" style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t</span></span><span class=\"C9DxTc \" style=\"font-variant: normal;\">The first paper of Ph.D. student </span><span class=\"C9DxTc \" style=\"font-family: Bitter, Arial; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700;\">Tatthapong Srikitrungruang</span><span class=\"C9DxTc \" style=\"font-variant: normal;\"> was accepted by </span><span class=\"C9DxTc \" style=\"font-style: italic; font-variant: normal;\">Advanced Science </span><span class=\"C9DxTc \" style=\"font-variant: normal;\">(IF &gt; 14). Congratulations, Tatthapong!</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" class=\"zfr3Q TYR86d eD0Rn \" style=\"margin-left: 15.0pt;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\" class=\"zfr3Q CDt4Ke \" style=\"margin-left: 0.0pt; padding-left: 0.0pt; text-indent: 0.0pt;\"><span class=\"C9DxTc \" style=\"font-variant: normal;\">2025.09.01</span><span class=\"C9DxTc \" style=\"font-variant: normal;\"><span class=\"Apple-tab-span \" style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t</span></span><span class=\"C9DxTc \" style=\"font-variant: normal;\">A new Ph.D. student, </span><span class=\"C9DxTc \" style=\"font-family: Bitter, Arial; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700;\">Tanvir Ahmed,</span><span class=\"C9DxTc \" style=\"font-variant: normal;\"> joined our group. Welcome, Tanvir!</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" class=\"zfr3Q TYR86d eD0Rn \" style=\"margin-left: 15.0pt;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\" class=\"zfr3Q CDt4Ke \" style=\"margin-left: 0.0pt; padding-left: 0.0pt; text-indent: 0.0pt;\"><span class=\"C9DxTc \" style=\"font-variant: normal;\">2025.04.22</span><span class=\"C9DxTc \" style=\"font-variant: normal;\"><span class=\"Apple-tab-span \" style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t</span></span><span class=\"C9DxTc \" style=\"font-variant: normal;\">Ph.D. student </span><span class=\"C9DxTc \" style=\"font-family: Bitter, Arial; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700;\">Sina Aghaee </span><span class=\"C9DxTc \" style=\"font-variant: normal;\">was selected as a finalist in the </span><span class=\"C9DxTc \" style=\"font-style: italic; font-variant: normal;\">IISE QCRE Best Student Paper Competition. </span><span class=\"C9DxTc \" style=\"font-variant: normal;\">Sina presented this work at the </span><span class=\"C9DxTc \" style=\"font-style: italic; font-variant: normal;\">2025 IISE Conference</span><span class=\"C9DxTc \" style=\"font-variant: normal;\">. Congratulations, Sina!&nbsp;</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" class=\"zfr3Q TYR86d eD0Rn \" style=\"margin-left: 15.0pt;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\" class=\"zfr3Q CDt4Ke \" style=\"margin-left: 0.0pt; padding-left: 0.0pt; text-indent: 0.0pt;\"><span class=\"C9DxTc \" style=\"\">2025.02.01</span><span class=\"C9DxTc \" style=\"\"><span class=\"Apple-tab-span \" style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t</span></span><span class=\"C9DxTc \" style=\"\">We are excited to begin the \"Cannery 4.0\" industry project with Crider Foods and look forward to building real-time machine breakdown prediction AI model.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" class=\"zfr3Q TYR86d eD0Rn \" style=\"margin-left: 15.0pt;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\" class=\"zfr3Q CDt4Ke \" style=\"margin-left: 0.0pt; padding-left: 0.0pt; text-indent: 0.0pt;\"><a class=\"XqQF9c\" href=\"http://2025.02.xx\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none;\"><span class=\"C9DxTc aw5Odc \" style=\"font-variant: normal;\">2024.12.</span></a><span class=\"C9DxTc \" style=\"font-variant: normal;\">10</span><span class=\"C9DxTc \" style=\"font-variant: normal;\"><span class=\"Apple-tab-span \" style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t</span></span><span class=\"C9DxTc \" style=\"font-variant: normal;\"><span class=\"Apple-tab-span \" style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t</span></span><span class=\"C9DxTc \" style=\"font-family: Bitter, Arial; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700;\">Dr. Lee</span><span class=\"C9DxTc \" style=\"font-variant: normal;\"> received </span><a class=\"XqQF9c\" href=\"https://tamids.tamu.edu/2025/01/06/2024-spaicd-recipients/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none;\"><span class=\"C9DxTc aw5Odc \" style=\"font-variant: normal; text-decoration: underline;\">the Seed Program for AI, Computing, and Data Science (SPAICD) Award</span></a><span class=\"C9DxTc \" style=\"font-variant: normal;\"> from the Texas A&amp;M Institute of Data Science (TAMIDS). This award was featured in the </span><a class=\"XqQF9c\" href=\"https://engineering.tamu.edu/news/2025/01/revolutionizing-dental-surgery-with-ai.html\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none;\"><span class=\"C9DxTc aw5Odc \" style=\"font-variant: normal; text-decoration: underline;\">College of Engineering News</span></a><span class=\"C9DxTc \" style=\"font-variant: normal;\"> and </span><a class=\"XqQF9c\" href=\"https://www.dental-tribune.com/news/bones-and-machines-ai-and-the-transformation-of-dental-implantology\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none;\"><span class=\"C9DxTc aw5Odc \" style=\"font-variant: normal; text-decoration: underline;\">the </span><span class=\"C9DxTc aw5Odc \" style=\"font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: underline;\">Dental Tribune International</span></a><span class=\"C9DxTc \" style=\"font-variant: normal;\">.</span></p></li></ul></li></ul>"
