      "text": "2024.12.11\t\tDr. Lee's paper \"Landmark-Embedded Gaussian Process  with Applications for  Functional Data Modeling\" received the IISE Transactions Best Paper Award from IISE Transactions. Dr. Lee presented this work at the 2024 IISE Conference.",
      "blocks": [
