      "text": "2024.07.22\tDr. Lee began serving as an Associate Editor of the Journal of Intelligent Manufacturing.2023.04.16\tThe paper co-authored by Dr. Lee \"Fully Inkjet-Printed, 2D Materials-Based Field-Effect Transistor for Water Sensing\" was recognized as one of the top-viewed articles in Advanced Materials Technologies in 2023.2022.10.04\tDr. Lee's paper \"Landmark-Embedded Gaussian Process  with Applications for  Functional Data Modeling,\" published in IISE Transactions, was featured in ISE Magazine.",
